OL,3,GNEWSASFA in talks with Boston officials
OL,4,Aover biannual friendly match
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC Scotland has learned that the SFA
OL,7,Fis in active discussions aimed at a
OL,8,Fbiannual friendly match being held in
OL,9,FBoston.
OL,11,FScotland played two World Cup matches
OL,12,Fin the US city during the summer and
OL,13,Fnow the governing body and the state of
OL,14,FMassachusetts are in talks aimed at
OL,15,Fbuilding the bonds made between locals
OL,16,Fand the Tartan Army, through football.
OL,18,FMore discussions are due to take place
OL,19,Fbetween the SFA and a delegation of
OL,20,Fstate senators ahead of Scotland's
OL,21,FNations League match against North
OL,22,FMacedonia at Hampden on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
