OL,3,GNEWSASFA in talks with Boston officials
OL,4,Aover biannual friendly match
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has not yet been decided who will
OL,7,Fplay in the game but BBC Scotland
OL,8,Funderstands it will involve the Scoland
OL,9,Fnational team.
